  "zh": "从引路人那里获得智慧或训练。",
  "file": "templates.js",
  "offset": "char@1271"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Crossing the Threshold",
  "zh": "跨越第一道门槛",
  "file": "templates.js",
  "offset": "char@1324"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Hero commits and enters the special world.",
  "zh": "主角下定决心，进入特殊世界。",
  "file": "templates.js",
  "offset": "char@1356"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Tests, Allies, Enemies",
  "zh": "考验、盟友、敌人",
  "file": "templates.js",
  "offset": "char@1419"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "New rules, new relationships, first challenges.",
  "zh": "新的规则、新的关系、最初的挑战。",
  "file": "templates.js",
  "offset": "char@1451"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Approach to the Inmost Cave",
  "zh": "接近最深的洞穴",
  "file": "templates.js",
  "offset": "char@1519"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Preparing for the central ordeal.",
  "zh": "为最核心的磨难做准备。",
  "file": "templates.js",
  "offset": "char@1556"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Ordeal",
  "zh": "磨难",
  "file": "templates.js",
  "offset": "char@1610"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "The biggest crisis so far. Death-and-rebirth moment.",
  "zh": "迄今最大的危机。死亡与重生的时刻。",
  "file": "templates.js",
  "offset": "char@1642"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Reward",
  "zh": "奖赏",
  "file": "templates.js",
  "offset": "char@1715"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Seize the prize. Celebration. New knowledge.",
  "zh": "夺得奖赏。庆祝。获得新的认知。",
  "file": "templates.js",
  "offset": "char@1747"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "The Road Back",
  "zh": "归途",
  "file": "templates.js",
  "offset": "char@1812"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Begin the return. New stakes, last temptations.",
  "zh": "开始返回。新的赌注，最后的诱惑。",
  "file": "templates.js",
  "offset": "char@1844"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Resurrection",
  "zh": "复活",
  "file": "templates.js",
  "offset": "char@1912"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Final climax. Hero is tested at their highest level.",
  "zh": "最终高潮。主角在最高层次上受到考验。",
  "file": "templates.js",
  "offset": "char@1944"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Return with the Elixir",
  "zh": "带着灵药归来",
  "file": "templates.js",
  "offset": "char@2017"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Hero returns home transformed, bringing something of value.",
  "zh": "主角焕然一新地回到家乡，并带回有价值的东西。",
  "file": "templates.js",
  "offset": "char@2049"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Fifteen beats",
  "zh": "十五节拍",
  "file": "templates.js",
  "offset": "char@2163"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Blank canvas",
  "zh": "空白画布",
  "file": "templates.js",
  "offset": "char@218"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "15 beats. The common commercial shape, from opening image to closing image.",
  "zh": "15 个节拍。常见的商业片结构，从开场画面到收尾画面。",
  "file": "templates.js",
  "offset": "char@2197"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Opening image",
  "zh": "开场画面",
  "file": "templates.js",
  "offset": "char@2304"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "The 'before' snapshot. Tone, mood, world.",
  "zh": "「之前」的快照。基调、情绪、世界。",
  "file": "templates.js",
  "offset": "char@2332"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "The question",
  "zh": "主题问题",
  "file": "templates.js",
  "offset": "char@2394"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Someone names, out loud, what the story is really about.",
  "zh": "有人把故事真正要讲的东西说出口。",
  "file": "templates.js",
  "offset": "char@2422"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Start from nothing. Add beats as you think.",
  "zh": "从零开始。边想边加节拍。",
  "file": "templates.js",
  "offset": "char@251"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Introduce the hero and the world. Plant what needs fixing.",
  "zh": "介绍主角与世界。埋下需要解决的问题。",
  "file": "templates.js",
  "offset": "char@2527"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "The disruption",
  "zh": "打破日常",
  "file": "templates.js",
  "offset": "char@2606"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "The thing that knocks the hero out of their world.",
  "zh": "把主角踢出原有世界的那件事。",
  "file": "templates.js",
  "offset": "char@2634"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Hesitation",
  "zh": "犹豫",
  "file": "templates.js",
  "offset": "char@2705"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Should I go? The last moment of refusing.",
  "zh": "我该去吗？最后的抗拒时刻。",
  "file": "templates.js",
  "offset": "char@2733"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Commitment",
  "zh": "下定决心",
  "file": "templates.js",
  "offset": "char@2795"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "The hero decides and steps into the new world.",
  "zh": "主角做出决定，迈入新世界。",
  "file": "templates.js",
  "offset": "char@2823"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Second thread",
  "zh": "第二条线",
  "file": "templates.js",
  "offset": "char@2890"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "A relationship or subplot that carries the theme.",
  "zh": "承载主题的一段关系或支线。",
  "file": "templates.js",
  "offset": "char@2918"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "The promise kept",
  "zh": "兑现承诺",
  "file": "templates.js",
  "offset": "char@2988"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "The part the audience came for. The premise, delivered.",
  "zh": "观众真正想看的部分。前提被兑现。",
  "file": "templates.js",
  "offset": "char@3016"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Midpoint",
  "zh": "中点",
  "file": "templates.js",
  "offset": "char@3092"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "A false win or a false loss. The stakes change shape.",
  "zh": "虚假的胜利或虚假的失败。赌注的形状改变。",
  "file": "templates.js",
  "offset": "char@3120"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Pressure builds",
  "zh": "压力升级",
  "file": "templates.js",
  "offset": "char@3194"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Outside forces close in. Inside, the cracks show.",
  "zh": "外部力量逼近。内部裂缝显现。",
  "file": "templates.js",
  "offset": "char@3222"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "The low point",
  "zh": "最低点",
  "file": "templates.js",
  "offset": "char@3292"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "The bottom. A death, literal or otherwise.",
  "zh": "谷底。一次死亡，字面或隐喻皆可。",
  "file": "templates.js",
  "offset": "char@3320"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "The reckoning",
  "zh": "清算",
  "file": "templates.js",
  "offset": "char@3383"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "The hero sits with the loss until something turns.",
  "zh": "主角与失去共处，直到某处开始转变。",
  "file": "templates.js",
  "offset": "char@3411"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "The new idea",
  "zh": "新的想法",
  "file": "templates.js",
  "offset": "char@3482"
 },
 {
