  "offset": "char@2046721"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "No Claude Desktop? You can still use the “Export for AI chat development” file to paste into any Claude chat — that path never goes away.",
  "zh": "没有 Claude 桌面版？你仍然可以用「导出供 AI 对话开发用」文件粘贴到任何 Claude 对话里 —— 这条路一直可用。",
  "file": "app.js",
  "offset": "char@2046786"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Let Beat set up Claude Desktop for you — it safely adds the Beat connection without touching your other Claude settings:",
