 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "N shots",
  "zh": "N 个镜头",
  "file": "app.js",
  "offset": "key:text@1190834"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Linking to Claude now keeps a copy of your existing configuration before it writes, so nothing of yours is lost if the merge goes wrong.",
  "zh": "「连接 Claude」现在会在写入前备份你现有的配置，所以即使合并不顺，也不会丢失你的东西。",
  "file": "app.js",
  "offset": "key:text@147479"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Reordering a gallery leaves your chosen picture alone. Dragging thumbs around never swaps out a hero you pinned on purpose.",
  "zh": "重新排列图集不会改变你选定的图片。拖动缩略图永远不会换掉你特意固定的主图。",
  "file": "app.js",
  "offset": "key:text@149201"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "The sample project, The Last Roll, exists because someone said plainly that the walkthrough got her in the door but never showed what Beat could do.",
  "zh": "示例项目《最后一卷》之所以存在，是因为有人直说：引导让她入了门，却从没展示 Beat 能做什么。",
  "file": "app.js",
  "offset": "key:text@149586"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Shift-click now adds and removes a card from the selection wherever you click on it. It only worked on the header before, which is the one part of a beat card you are least likely to aim at.",
  "zh": "Shift + 单击现在可以在卡片的任意位置加入或移出选择。以前只在标题条上有效，而那恰好是节拍卡片上你最不会瞄的地方。",
  "file": "app.js",
  "offset": "key:text@150723"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Images can leave a gallery. Drag one onto the canvas, or onto another image in the same gallery to reorder. Until now pictures could go into a gallery and never come out.",
  "zh": "图片可以离开图集了。把一张拖到画布上，或拖到同一图集里的另一张图上即可重排。此前图片进了图集就再也出不来。",
  "file": "app.js",
  "offset": "key:text@150933"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "The Vault scrolls down at every thumbnail size. It used to start scrolling sideways once the thumbnails were small enough to fit more columns.",
  "zh": "保险库在任何缩略图尺寸下都向下滚动。以前缩略图小到能放更多列时，它会改成横向滚动。",
  "file": "app.js",
  "offset": "key:text@151123"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Shift-click in the Vault picks several items at once, and dragging one of them brings them all onto the canvas.",
  "zh": "在保险库里 Shift + 单击可一次选中多项，拖动其中一项会把它们一起带到画布上。",
  "file": "app.js",
  "offset": "key:text@151285"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Nothing about how Beat works has changed in this version. It is the same 2.0.10 you already had, properly signed. That was the whole point.",
  "zh": "这个版本里 Beat 的工作方式没有任何改变。就是你已有的 2.0.10，只是签名正确了。这就是全部意义。",
  "file": "app.js",
  "offset": "key:text@152053"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Because it is per camera, a plan can hold an ALEXA 35 on a 35 and a VENICE 2 on a 40 at once, each with its own true cone. It is set once and only changes when you change it.",
  "zh": "因为它按摄影机设定，一个计划可以同时容纳装在 35 上的 ALEXA 35 和装在 40 上的 VENICE 2，各有各的真实视角锥。它只需设定一次，只有你改动时才变。",
  "file": "app.js",
  "offset": "key:text@153983"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "The format is printed on the plan itself, top left of the floor, so an angle is never a number without a sensor behind it. It rides along into the image export and into your PDF and Word documents.",
  "zh": "画幅会印在计划本身的地面左上角，所以角度永远不是没有传感器作依托的数字。它也会随图片导出，进入你的 PDF 和 Word 文档。",
  "file": "app.js",
  "offset": "key:text@155903"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "The call sheet writes itself — give a shoot day its date, location, call time and crew, and Beat prints a professional call sheet: sunrise and sunset, the schedule, per-person calls, cast and props.",
  "zh": "通告单会自己生成 —— 给拍摄日填上日期、地点、集合时间和剧组，Beat 就会打印一张专业通告单：日出日落、日程、个人集合时间、演员和道具。",
  "file": "app.js",
  "offset": "key:text@159165"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Wrap the day — one button ends the shoot, shows what is in the can against what was skipped, carries unshot setups to the next day, and prints a wrap report.",
  "zh": "收工 —— 一个按钮结束拍摄，对照已拍与跳过，把未拍的机位带到下一天，并打印收工报告。",
  "file": "app.js",
  "offset": "key:text@159393"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Sockets and coloured wires — every connection gets its own plug on the card edge and its own colour, shared by the wire and both rings, so you can trace any line at a glance.",
  "zh": "插口与彩色连线 —— 每条连接在卡片边缘都有自己的插头和自己颜色，线与两端圆环共用同一颜色，一眼就能追到任意一条线。",
  "file": "app.js",
  "offset": "key:text@162114"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Audio timeline — drop a song anywhere on the canvas and it plays under your story as a waveform. Drop markers, drag them, name them, then turn them into beats that carry their timecode.",
  "zh": "音频时间轴 —— 把一首歌拖到画布任意位置，它就会以波形形式在你的故事下方播放。放置标记、拖动、命名，再把它们变成带时间码的节拍。",
  "file": "app.js",
  "offset": "key:text@162572"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Sketch — a blank drawing card for shots that do not exist yet, with a 45-piece stamp library: shot framings, people, day and night, interiors, gear and arrows.",
  "zh": "草图 —— 给还不存在的镜头用的空白绘制卡片，带 45 件图章库：景别框、人物、日与夜、室内、器材和箭头。",
  "file": "app.js",
  "offset": "key:text@162787"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Custom fields on beats — define your own, like Emotion and Rhythm, with presets, on every beat or a single card, flowing into exports and the shot list.",
  "zh": "节拍上的自定义字段 —— 自己定义，比如情绪和节奏，可带预设，可作用于每个节拍或单张卡片，并流入导出和镜头表。",
  "file": "app.js",
  "offset": "key:text@162988"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Checklists — a field on a beat can be a checklist, and there is a whole checklist card: tickable items, Enter for the next one, live in Writing Mode, printed with real boxes in your PDFs.",
  "zh": "清单 —— 节拍上的字段可以是清单，还有整张清单卡片：可勾选条目，回车加下一条，在写作模式中实时可见，PDF 里打印成真正的方框。",
  "file": "app.js",
  "offset": "key:text@163182"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "The Outline reads like a document — numbered rows with a body excerpt, a duration and a thumbnail, under group headers that count their beats and sum their runtime.",
  "zh": "大纲读起来像文档 —— 带编号的行，含正文摘录、时长和缩略图，分组标题会统计其节拍数并累加总时长。",
  "file": "app.js",
  "offset": "key:text@164080"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Line things up — select a few cards and the toolbar offers align left, centre and right, top, middle and bottom, and even spacing — across cards, images, links, embeds and documents alike.",
  "zh": "对齐 —— 选中几张卡片，工具栏就提供左对齐、居中、右对齐、顶部、中部、底部对齐，以及等距分布 —— 卡片、图片、链接、嵌入和文档都一样。",
  "file": "app.js",
  "offset": "key:text@164921"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Faster under the hand — taps land instantly in On set, drags stay smooth on heavy boards, and saving never gets in the way.",
  "zh": "手感更快 —— 在拍摄模式下点按立即响应，重型画布上拖动依旧顺滑，保存再也不会挡路。",
  "file": "app.js",
  "offset": "key:text@165472"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Made with Beat",
  "zh": "用 Beat 制作",
  "file": "app.js",
  "offset": "key:text@1681210"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Note:",
  "zh": "备注：",
  "file": "app.js",
  "offset": "key:text@1685362"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Address:",
  "zh": "地址：",
  "file": "app.js",
  "offset": "key:text@1687592"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Set plan ·",
  "zh": "场景计划 ·",
  "file": "app.js",
  "offset": "key:text@1689893"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Much faster and steadier — smoother dragging and panning, tamed GIFs, and a fix for the multi-minute save hang on cloud and external drives.",
  "zh": "快得多也稳得多 —— 拖动与平移更顺滑、GIF 得到约束，并修好了云盘和外接盘上长达数分钟的保存卡顿。",
  "file": "app.js",
  "offset": "key:text@168997"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Clean cards — optionally hide empty fields until you hover, for a tidier board.",
  "zh": "简洁卡片 —— 可选地隐藏空字段，悬停时才显示，画布更清爽。",
  "file": "app.js",
  "offset": "key:text@169175"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Shot Type:",
  "zh": "景别：",
  "file": "app.js",
  "offset": "key:text@1693113"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Duration:",
  "zh": "时长：",
  "file": "app.js",
  "offset": "key:text@1693348"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Involves:",
  "zh": "涉及：",
  "file": "app.js",
  "offset": "key:text@1694309"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Alternative version",
  "zh": "备选版本",
  "file": "app.js",
  "offset": "key:text@1695332"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "Customize Beat Nodes — choose which fields show on your beats, per project.",
  "zh": "自定义节拍节点 —— 按项目选择在你的节拍上显示哪些字段。",
  "file": "app.js",
  "offset": "key:text@170278"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "The portrait",
  "zh": "肖像",
  "file": "app.js",
  "offset": "key:title@101335"
 },
 {
  "source": "embedded-web",
  "en": "The bed",
  "zh": "床",
  "file": "app.js",
  "offset": "key:title@101892"
 },
 {
